{"title":"Alfred Brendel, RIP","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920360696/0/marginalrevolution~Alfred-Brendel-RIP.html","date":1750183141000,"content":"<p>His <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=alfred+brendel+haydn+piano+sonatas&amp;sca_esv=35b79497141ac1f1&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=f6xRaIrLJu6skdUPntmH2Ag&amp;iflsig=AOw8s4IAAAAAaFG6j5tflywS99QWDOSO6b6pHzfxWzuE&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjKhvryg_mNAxVuVqQEHZ7sAYsQ4dUDCBc&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=alfred+brendel+haydn+piano+sonatas&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6IiJhbGZyZWQgYnJlbmRlbCBoYXlkbiBwaWFubyBzb25hdGFzMgYQABgWGB4yBhAAGBYYHjIFEAAY7wUyBRAAGO8FMgUQABjvBTIFEAAY7wVIijFQAFiXLHAAeACQAQCYAW-gAfAVqgEEMjkuNbgBA8gBAPgBAZgCIqAC1RbCAgsQLhiABBjRAxjHAcICBRAAGIAEwgIFEC4YgATCAggQLhiABBjUAsICCxAuGIAEGMcBGK8BwgILEAAYgAQYhgMYigXCAggQABiiBBiJBZgDAJIHBDI4LjagB_q1ArIHBDI4Lja4B9UWwgcIMC4yNS44LjHIB1c&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">Haydn piano sonatas</a> were his best work and also they were pathbreaking in helping us understand that composer.  I also very much appreciated his short Beethoven pieces on the old Vox box set, starting with the Bagatelles, and as a live performer his Schubert was memorable…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/alfred-brendel-rip.html\">Alfred Brendel, RIP</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920360696/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920360696/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920360696/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/2